<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:57:36Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>India news: Cyclone Arnab brings heavy rain, disruption</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e8fceb225deb4e2691b33d709800f0716f16f5c3183dbc4dd37aa8ea5f2243af</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:57:27Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T04:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-cyclone-arnab-brings-heavy-rain-disruption/live-79782323--40805b0929cb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-cyclone-arnab-brings-heavy-rain-disruption/live-79782323?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Cyclone Arnab is making a slow-motion landfall at India's east coast with states evacuating thousands of residents. Also, a new report says India is among nations with highest heatwave exposure for infants. Follow live</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Israel election: Exit polls show no clear winner, with Netanyahu's fate unclear</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b0e8ce2321cbbe273b88f281b9a797d436a8c110b86ec92f171d4e9552556d6d</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:57:30Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T02:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/israel-election-exit-polls-show-no-clear-winner-with-netanyahu-s-fate-unclear/live-79713839--73888c64d9c5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/israel-election-exit-polls-show-no-clear-winner-with-netanyahu-s-fate-unclear/live-79713839?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">While partial results show the pro-Netanyahu and anti-Netanyahu blocs almost even, it may take days for the final tally. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Experts urge 'global health emergency' as climate harms accelerate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8442add2fbe2cbe0e1ddd2cee6d92083ef777cb6bd2892104a609145be59f4e0</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:57:33Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T00:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/experts-urge-global-health-emergency-as-climate-harms-accelerate/a-79773232--6973c15b8839.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/experts-urge-global-health-emergency-as-climate-harms-accelerate/a-79773232?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Heat, drought and storms linked to climate change are already killing millions worldwide. Researchers want global warming to be declared a global health emergency as the health harms from it escalate faster than ever.</summary><category term="Climate" /></entry><entry><title>Egypt orders closure of independent news site Mada Masr</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5fb30d326ff27fb03383b41a628d75e4f3bdedf17026557843bd50b90983a95e</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:57:36Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T23:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/egypt-orders-closure-of-independent-news-site-mada-masr/a-79781842--499fd97538eb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/egypt-orders-closure-of-independent-news-site-mada-masr/a-79781842?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Editor-in-chief Lina Attalah was briefly detained and fined over licensing violations. Rights groups condemned the ruling as a major blow to press freedom in Egypt, where independent media face growing pressure.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Flavio Bolsonaro flees Brazil for US amid investigation  — reports</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f842eb3fe9c8b95fa37dccdb1ede21491984619ec285cb37e96ac495083346f5</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T22:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/flavio-bolsonaro-flees-brazil-for-us-amid-investigation-reports/a-79781094--8df6e790d366.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/flavio-bolsonaro-flees-brazil-for-us-amid-investigation-reports/a-79781094?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Flavio Bolsonaro is on the way to the US, according to reports citing people close to the senator. The US State Department said it will issue visas to the senator and his family.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU proposes giving Frontex border agency new major powers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d07f634d0ac53411bf2ff75e1e4c250f0a54adca95a8186d5f83327979871524</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T17:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-proposes-giving-frontex-border-agency-new-major-powers/a-79779690--2177a1c8ad5b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-proposes-giving-frontex-border-agency-new-major-powers/a-79779690?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The European Commission has unveiled a new plan to give Frontex more resources to ensure the return of irregular migrants, including by supporting non-EU countries. The move comes after the tragedy in Ceuta.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Mbappe apologizes as Chinese sponsors drop him and TV broadcasts are halted over Mao dictator remark</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:083b4097fbc485a5d3e300e74802820ffff2bdba10b41d8dae0f1f8c8e0ec306</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T16:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/mbappe-apologizes-as-chinese-sponsors-drop-him-and-tv-broadcasts-are-halted-over-mao-dictator-remark/a-79779831--140a68dc18a5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/mbappe-apologizes-as-chinese-sponsors-drop-him-and-tv-broadcasts-are-halted-over-mao-dictator-remark/a-79779831?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">French soccer star Kylian Mbappe has apologized after apparently referring to Mao Zedong as a dictator. Chinese sponsors have dropped him, while state television has suspended Spanish league broadcasts.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Myanmar: Is the US undermining the EU's diplomatic blockade?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e10d8aed82ff1e8466763c917de11a7108685303f746befac393b15715c03742</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T15:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/myanmar-is-the-us-undermining-the-eu-s-diplomatic-blockade/a-79778863--db2dea3e5776.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-is-the-us-undermining-the-eu-s-diplomatic-blockade/a-79778863?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">With the US reopening talks with Myanmar's military-backed government, and several Southeast Asian countries restarting diplomatic contacts, the EU is facing uncomfortable questions about its own boycott of the junta.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Harry Kane: Ballon d’Or for Bayern Munich striker</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4178a155c407ed7820c4ffa6c0dcdc47b65e4a9b251f9980ad7b611ebf296b80</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T14:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/harry-kane-ballon-d-or-for-bayern-munich-striker/a-79723299--2a5c9f9ed870.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/harry-kane-ballon-d-or-for-bayern-munich-striker/a-79723299?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bayern Munich striker Harry Kane has won football's most prestigious individual prize, beating Kylian Mbappe and Lamine Yamal. Kane has developed even more in the Bundesliga despite an uneven league.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Will elections in Israel change its Iran approach?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cd88968447adafde6b8e27a7b44ccae39a59d5d5bdd29a901d782116fc102cba</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T13:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/will-elections-in-israel-change-its-iran-approach/a-79776122--d46c291154a3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/will-elections-in-israel-change-its-iran-approach/a-79776122?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Israelis head to the polls, the country's conflict with Iran casts a long shadow over the ballot box. But any leadership changes in Israel may not be enough to shake up its grand strategy on Tehran.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Denmark's Frederiksen criticizes Finland and Norway for calling Putin without coordinating with allies, despite consultation with Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:93694549088f239b91a9a1d5c47fb44aeeeec06441a88e5fac188a7de69d1006</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T12:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/denmark-s-frederiksen-criticizes-finland-and-norway-for-calling-putin-without-coordinating-with-alli/a-79776208--b9062a9ff501.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/denmark-s-frederiksen-criticizes-finland-and-norway-for-calling-putin-without-coordinating-with-allies-despite-consultation-with-ukraine/a-79776208?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Finland and Norway have called Putin about ending the Ukraine war, drawing Danish criticism. The dispute highlights divisions over European engagement with Moscow ahead of planned US-led peace talks.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Jordan acknowledges civilian casualties in Syria airstrike against 'Islamic State'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4e2261c4ef39cc21a2f60cda0d3b552ac3a98b9a09d01daed686230c1ba55386</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T12:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/jordan-acknowledges-civilian-casualties-in-syria-airstrike-against-islamic-state/a-79775653--7282e0a35d06.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/jordan-acknowledges-civilian-casualties-in-syria-airstrike-against-islamic-state/a-79775653?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Jordanian government spokesman has expressed "regret" over civilian casualties in an airstrike it said was targeting "IS" militants.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>DR Congo reports over 10,000 Ebola cases as the outbreak spreads abroad, with no approved vaccine or specific treatment for the Bundibugyo virus</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a86d267ccf38318b6f5c077937b13d252ec4524579263ba2bb0d91c82bb2c4c8</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T11:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/dr-congo-reports-over-10-000-ebola-cases-as-the-outbreak-spreads-abroad-with-no-approved-vaccine-or-/a-79773667--055ba7810ea4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/dr-congo-reports-over-10-000-ebola-cases-as-the-outbreak-spreads-abroad-with-no-approved-vaccine-or-specific-treatment-for-the-bundibugyo-virus/a-79773667?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">DR Congo has reported more than 10,000 Ebola cases and nearly 4,900 deaths. The outbreak involves a virus for which there is no approved vaccine or specific treatment, complicating efforts to contain its spread.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's Merz says erosion of global order means middle powers in Europe and Asia must be more assertive</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:198ecafbb19a93cf6d4c2f381d4ac425573905bd1966ffc0633f0b3b13944580</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T09:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-merz-says-erosion-of-global-order-means-middle-powers-in-europe-and-asia-must-be-more-asse/live-79772992--98272a034e7e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-merz-says-erosion-of-global-order-means-middle-powers-in-europe-and-asia-must-be-more-assertive/live-79772992?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">During a visit to Singapore, German Chancellor Friedrich Merz said Europe and Germany want to increase free trade with open competition, reliability and a rules-based order.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Two men face UK national security charges following an incident near RAF Fairford, with police suspecting Iranian state involvement</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:19d1a363eee8400e326663bcd2637f72fd211cdd8474173fcbbd9915731e3c73</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T09:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/two-men-face-uk-national-security-charges-following-an-incident-near-raf-fairford-with-police-suspec/a-79773432--5ee211ad289a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/two-men-face-uk-national-security-charges-following-an-incident-near-raf-fairford-with-police-suspecting-iranian-state-involvement/a-79773432?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">British prosecutors have charged two men over an incident near RAF Fairford in September. Police suspect Iranian involvement in the case at a base used for US strikes on Iran.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Police in northern Germany search for suspects after car ramming overnight injures several</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cfdb620eb311e0fcb7e23eba5d0c28859e4c7c0fe72202715b16453e2c07753d</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T07:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/police-in-northern-germany-search-for-suspects-after-car-ramming-overnight-injures-several/a-78107062--249602b37b60.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/police-in-northern-germany-search-for-suspects-after-car-ramming-overnight-injures-several/a-78107062?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A person intentionally drove into a group of people in a northern German town, police have said. Three people have been taken into custody in what police said was likely a gang confrontation.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Arunachal sees fresh violence over proposed dam</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a7aab5aa480c7ef853f2475877b006a9413bdca943595ea061aea31c7f6fa735</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T07:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-arunachal-sees-fresh-violence-over-proposed-dam/live-79771650--d59bfea6f557.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-arunachal-sees-fresh-violence-over-proposed-dam/live-79771650?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">More violence erupted in India's northeastern state of Arunachal Pradesh over proposed hydroelectric projects that locals are protesting. Also, India's top court will hear pleas against the poll body chief.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil elections: Merz, world leaders congratulate Lula on his win</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1244b7d41010d5da031e1a3a3ee25ccab2f2777151624485d53022ab364b1b39</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T04:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-elections-merz-world-leaders-congratulate-lula-on-his-win/live-79755630--42141a0af1cc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-elections-merz-world-leaders-congratulate-lula-on-his-win/live-79755630?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Brazilian President Lula secured a surprise win over far-right challenger Flavio Bolsonaro, whose party recognizes Lula's election victory.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine and Russia begin Oleshky ceasefire for aid mission</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:824532cec68b0dfdd01f465f20f380cbf939d6d5e253f63f4653022da6cc526d</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T03:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-and-russia-begin-oleshky-ceasefire-for-aid-mission/a-79771473--bf865826a254.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-and-russia-begin-oleshky-ceasefire-for-aid-mission/a-79771473?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Around 2,000 people remain stranded in the city of Oleshky, facing severe shortages of food and medicine. The Russian-occupied town has been devastated by fighting and flooding since Moscow's invasion in 2022.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US seeks new charges against former FBI chief James Comey</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:773572bdf2965d20989cbb38e198457ded7075fc995369ce41bc5621e49c358d</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T01:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-seeks-new-charges-against-former-fbi-chief-james-comey/a-79771256--b8a272db5879.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-seeks-new-charges-against-former-fbi-chief-james-comey/a-79771256?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Trump administration accuses the former FBI director of leaking classified information a decade ago. Comey denies wrongdoing, while his lawyers argue the case is legally invalid and comes too late.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>England and Bayern Munich striker Harry Kane wins Ballon d'Or</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ff21d1ab64358e5a1f8bd28e4c8eb702899a1c1a5d0bc47ba27747247a4d0f01</id><updated>2026-10-28T05:56:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T23:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/england-and-bayern-munich-striker-harry-kane-wins-ballon-d-or/a-79771067--21e06316b487.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/england-and-bayern-munich-striker-harry-kane-wins-ballon-d-or/a-79771067?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The England captain ends his country's 25-year wait for the prestigious award after scoring 73 goals for club and country last season, beating competition from Lamine Yamal and Kylian Mbappe.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
